From d27350d14facd758c5e271cc63cc790b8f8fd6b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:51:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 088/197] Fix three behaviors of the integrated environment

- 'New part' goes on to the sketch plane choice only when run from the
  toolbar or menu, not from a script (where the dialog stopped the script).
  The start page asks for the sketch plane itself.
- The '(double-click to edit)' hint is shown for faces and edges only;
  double-clicking a vertex does nothing.
- Pressing 'Hole' twice with nothing picked no longer waits for the face
  twice (and made two holes).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/Gui/Selection/Selection.cpp        | 12 +++++++++---
 src/Mod/PartDesign/Gui/CommandBody.cpp | 11 +++++++----
 src/Mod/Start/Gui/StartView.cpp        | 11 ++++++++---
 src/Mod/Unified/UnifiedCommands.py     |  7 ++++++-
 4 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

